{
  "version": 2,
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "dlg_anomaly_researcher_after_signal",
      "npc": "anomaly_researcher",
      "habitat_id": "radiant_spire",
      "topic": "signal_marks",
      "weight": 6,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "塔区",
        "撤离线"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_spire_signal_marks"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "安全标记一立起来，塔区就不像一堵只会吼人的墙了。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "至少今天知道哪几步能退。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "原来稳定窗口最值钱的是这点余裕。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "知道退路，人才敢把前路看清。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "没错，短短一会儿，够把慌乱变成秩序。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_anomaly_researcher_daily_measure",
      "npc": "anomaly_researcher",
      "habitat_id": "radiant_spire",
      "topic": "calm_measure",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "异常",
        "测量"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "day",
          "evening",
          "night"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "在塔区做记录，先量的不是光，是自己还能不能把呼吸放慢。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "人先稳住，表才读得准。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "难怪你每次都先站着不说话。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "没错。手一抖，最先被放大的就是误判。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "因为这地方会把慌张放得比回声还大。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_anomaly_researcher_window",
      "npc": "anomaly_researcher",
      "habitat_id": "radiant_spire",
      "topic": "calm_window",
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_spire_calm_window"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "稳定窗口不会提前打招呼，能抓住一次，就少一次硬闯。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "今天那一下安静得像整座塔区在屏息。",
              "next": "breath"
            },
            {
              "text": "隙鹿好像终于肯停下来听我们说话了。",
              "next": "fawn"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "breath",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "你感觉得很准。越是危险的地方，越需要人先学会听它什么时候不再尖叫。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "fawn",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "它们不是不信人，只是不信会突然改变的世界。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "calm_window"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_boarder_liu_care",
      "npc": "boarder_liu",
      "habitat_id": "sky_post",
      "topic": "boarding",
      "conditions": {
        "after_quest": "boarding_pen_prep"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "boarder_liu",
          "text": "托管不是把宠物放下就完了，得让它知道主人会回来。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你会先记下它熟悉的声音和动作？",
              "next": "note"
            },
            {
              "text": "难怪临时托管中心的布料都这么柔软。",
              "next": "cloth"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "note",
          "speaker": "boarder_liu",
          "text": "对，陌生地方里最先起作用的，往往是熟悉感。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "cloth",
          "speaker": "boarder_liu",
          "text": "环境一软，心就不那么绷着，吃东西也会更稳。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "boarding"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_boarder_liu_daily_blanket",
      "npc": "boarder_liu",
      "habitat_id": "sky_post",
      "topic": "boarding_blanket",
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "托管",
        "安抚"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "evening",
          "night"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "boarder_liu",
          "text": "临时托管中心里最先准备的从来不是碗，是带着旧味道的布。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "先让它闻到熟悉感。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那布料要多久换一次？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "boarder_liu",
          "text": "对，心一松，胃口和睡意才会回来。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "boarder_liu",
          "text": "脏了就洗，味道散了就补，不能只图干净。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_field_recorder_after_hum",
      "npc": "field_recorder",
      "habitat_id": "ancient_platform",
      "topic": "panel_hum",
      "weight": 6,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "回声",
        "监测站"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_platform_panel_hum"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "面板一稳，回声就不再散成一团。你今天帮的是修复，也是翻译。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "翻译监测站想留下来的声音。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那这份记录总算像样了。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "对，先让它别发抖，话才说得完整。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "像样，而且留住了顺序。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_field_recorder_daily_echo",
      "npc": "field_recorder",
      "habitat_id": "ancient_platform",
      "topic": "echo_listening",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "回声",
        "记录"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "evening",
          "night"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "监测站有时候不是在响，是在等人把同一句话听第二遍。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "第二遍和第一遍有什么不同？",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "所以你总要我先站着别记。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "第一遍是新奇，第二遍才会开始分辨方向。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "耳朵先记住，笔才不会把回声写扁。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_field_recorder_resonance",
      "npc": "field_recorder",
      "habitat_id": "ancient_platform",
      "topic": "resonance",
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_platform_echo_bloom"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "你看这道辉尘轨迹，它不是乱飞，是在追一段旧回声。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "像是在读监测站留下来的记忆。",
              "next": "memory"
            },
            {
              "text": "那我们是该先记，还是先修？",
              "next": "record_or_fix"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "memory",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "没错。很多旧站区不是沉默，只是没人把它们的话记下来。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "record_or_fix",
          "speaker": "field_recorder",
          "text": "先记住，再修；不然修完了，你反而不知道自己保住了什么。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "resonance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_innkeeper_yun_after_late_board",
      "npc": "innkeeper_yun",
      "habitat_id": "sky_post",
      "topic": "late_board",
      "weight": 6,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "夜间留言",
        "转运站"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_post_late_board"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "夜里把社区信息屏重新排顺，其实就是替明早少走几段冤枉路。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "怪不得你说转运站也是照料。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "今天这活看起来小，倒真省事。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "是啊，照料的不只是一只宠物，也是一群要赶路的人。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "小事做稳，整条路都会顺一点。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_innkeeper_yun_daily_board",
      "npc": "innkeeper_yun",
      "habitat_id": "sky_post",
      "topic": "message_board",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "转运站",
        "留言"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "required_building": {
          "id": "message_board",
          "min_level": 1
        }
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "转运站最安静的时候，不是没人来，是每张社区信息屏都摆在该摆的位置上。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你看板子的速度比看人的速度还快。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "我还以为转运站最重要的是热茶。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "先把消息安顿好，人自然知道该往哪去。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "热茶管腿脚，消息管方向，两样都不能少。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_innkeeper_yun_letters",
      "npc": "innkeeper_yun",
      "habitat_id": "sky_post",
      "topic": "letters",
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_post_storm_layover"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "雨一大，路就慢，可消息不能慢。转运站最值钱的不是屋檐，是准时。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以社区信息屏得一直有人看着。",
              "next": "board"
            },
            {
              "text": "临时托管中心也会在雨天更忙吧。",
              "next": "boarding"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "board",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "对。谁先看到消息，谁就先把一条路重新接上。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "boarding",
          "speaker": "innkeeper_yun",
          "text": "雨天来的同行宠物更容易累，先稳住它们，人才走得踏实。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "letters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_lost_apprentice_daily_notes",
      "npc": "lost_apprentice",
      "habitat_id": "mist_moss_cave",
      "topic": "field_notes",
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "记录",
        "学徒"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "day",
          "evening"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "lost_apprentice",
          "text": "我现在学会把笔记分成两页了：一页写“看见了什么”，一页写“别立刻去做什么”。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "后面那页听起来更难。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "我可以帮你把条目抄得更整齐。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "lost_apprentice",
          "text": "对，因为人一紧张就喜欢马上伸手。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "lost_apprentice",
          "text": "那太好了，我负责记快一点，你负责让以后的人看得懂。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_lost_apprentice_notes",
      "npc": "lost_apprentice",
      "habitat_id": "mist_moss_cave",
      "topic": "notes",
      "conditions": {
        "after_quest": "find_apprentice_notes"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "lost_apprentice",
          "text": "我把找回来的那本笔记重新抄了一遍，这次终于不会再塞进会掉出来的口袋了。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "里面最重要的是哪一页？",
              "next": "page"
            },
            {
              "text": "下次我陪你一起记。",
              "next": "together"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "page",
          "speaker": "lost_apprentice",
          "text": "是记录“什么时候别去碰幼体”的那页，照料不只是喂和抱。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "together",
          "speaker": "lost_apprentice",
          "text": "那太好了，我记得快，你看得细，我们正好互补。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "notes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_moss_keeper_after_wipe",
      "npc": "moss_keeper",
      "habitat_id": "mist_moss_cave",
      "topic": "dew_wipe",
      "weight": 6,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "晨雾",
        "幼护"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_moss_morning_wipe"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "护理室门口的雾珠一擦干，里面的小家伙连翻身都踏实了些。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "原来只是少一点湿气，差别就这么大。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那今天这活算是做对了。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "幼体分不清道理，只分得清舒服和不舒服。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "做对了，而且做得不吵。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_moss_keeper_daily_heat",
      "npc": "moss_keeper",
      "habitat_id": "mist_moss_cave",
      "topic": "nest_heat",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "恒温护理室",
        "幼护"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "day",
          "evening"
        ],
        "required_building": {
          "id": "warm_nest",
          "min_level": 1
        }
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "白天摸窝边，晚上摸窝心。热不是越多越好，是得让幼体愿意自己靠过去。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "那我以后先看它往哪边拱。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "难怪你总要先把手烘暖。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "对，先看它自己选哪一边，别急着替它决定。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "手太冷，连安慰都会像打扰。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_moss_keeper_night_watch",
      "npc": "moss_keeper",
      "habitat_id": "mist_moss_cave",
      "topic": "night_watch",
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_moss_night_watch"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "听见没？苔团睡着的时候，呼吸像在拨一层薄雾。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "我刚才差点不敢出声。",
              "next": "reply_soft"
            },
            {
              "text": "原来它们真的会跟着哼唱放松。",
              "next": "reply_hum"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_soft",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "照料幼体，很多时候不是做得多，而是别惊到它们。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_hum",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "会的。你以后来守夜，它们会记得你的声音。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "night_watch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_parts_vendor_daily_salvage",
      "npc": "parts_vendor",
      "habitat_id": "copper_hammer_bazaar",
      "topic": "salvage_bins",
      "weight": 3,
      "cooldown_days": 3,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "配件",
        "淘换"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "season_in": [
          "spring",
          "summer"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "parts_vendor",
          "text": "配件贩最会分的不是价格，是“还能直接用”和“得碰上对的人才有用”。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你箱子上的标签都写得很怪。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那我这种半懂不懂的呢？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "parts_vendor",
          "text": "不怪怎么分得开？真正会买的人一看就懂。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "parts_vendor",
          "text": "那就多问两句，别把好东西买回去当垫脚。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_ruin_restorer_daily_panels",
      "npc": "ruin_restorer",
      "habitat_id": "ancient_platform",
      "topic": "panel_repair",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "修复",
        "旧站区"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "required_building": {
          "id": "repair_bench",
          "min_level": 1
        }
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "ruin_restorer",
          "text": "修旧站区最费的不是零件，是把“先别动”忍住。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "因为先动了，痕迹就没了。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那你什么时候才算肯下手？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "ruin_restorer",
          "text": "对，很多断口比完整面板更会说话。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "ruin_restorer",
          "text": "当我知道拆掉这一片，不会顺手把昨天也拆掉。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_smith_ya_daily_hammer",
      "npc": "smith_ya",
      "habitat_id": "copper_hammer_bazaar",
      "topic": "hammer_rhythm",
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "锻打",
        "节奏"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "day",
          "evening"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "smith_ya",
          "text": "哑叔抬手轻敲两下铁胚，又把耳朵偏过来，像是在听它回话。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "你是在听里面有没有空响？",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "所以你连安静都要敲出节奏。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "smith_ya",
          "text": "哑叔点点头，指尖又在台面敲出一个稳稳的节拍。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "smith_ya",
          "text": "哑叔笑了一下，把锤柄递给你，示意先稳住手，再谈力道。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_stone_trader_daily_route",
      "npc": "stone_trader",
      "habitat_id": "crystal_creek",
      "topic": "road_goods",
      "weight": 3,
      "cooldown_days": 3,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "行商",
        "材料"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "season_in": [
          "spring",
          "autumn"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "stone_trader",
          "text": "石片这种东西，值钱的时候不在摊上，在它被谁握过、在哪条路上磨过。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你卖的不只是材料。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "难怪你总先问我要拿去干什么。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "stone_trader",
          "text": "对，卖的是它适合落到谁手里。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "stone_trader",
          "text": "问清去处，才知道该给你硬一点还是软一点的。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_tinker_bo_after_demo",
      "npc": "tinker_bo",
      "habitat_id": "copper_hammer_bazaar",
      "topic": "demo_story",
      "weight": 6,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "夜市",
        "旧件"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_bazaar_spare_demo"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "摊前那一圈人散了以后，留下来的往往才是真想学的人。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "今天那块旧齿轮倒把大家都讲安静了。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "你讲故事的时候比修东西还像行家。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "因为有人第一次发现，旧东西不是只配被丢。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "讲得明白，东西才会有第二次用处。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_tinker_bo_daily_spare",
      "npc": "tinker_bo",
      "habitat_id": "copper_hammer_bazaar",
      "topic": "spare_parts",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "零件",
        "修补"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "time_in": [
          "day",
          "evening"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "有人看零件只看缺口，我更爱看它还剩下哪点倔劲。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "旧东西也有“脾气”？",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "所以你修东西像在认人。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "当然，有的怎么敲都闷，有的一装上就肯亮。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "修久了都一样，先认脾气，再谈办法。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_tinker_bo_night_swap",
      "npc": "tinker_bo",
      "habitat_id": "copper_hammer_bazaar",
      "topic": "night_swap",
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_bazaar_night_swap"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "白天卖的是东西，晚上换的多半是故事。旧零件的来路可比价签有意思。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "这块零件原来装在哪？",
              "next": "origin"
            },
            {
              "text": "那为什么还总有人抢着换？",
              "next": "why"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "origin",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "有些从北城城市监测站来，有些从转运线废棚拆下，能不能再派上用场，要看眼力。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "why",
          "speaker": "tinker_bo",
          "text": "因为会修的人知道，旧东西里常藏着新办法。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "night_swap"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_traveling_peddler_daily_rumor",
      "npc": "traveling_peddler",
      "habitat_id": "sky_post",
      "topic": "road_rumor",
      "weight": 3,
      "cooldown_days": 3,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "行路",
        "传闻"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "season_in": [
          "spring",
          "summer",
          "autumn"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "traveling_peddler",
          "text": "赶路的人最怕的不是绕远，是带着过时的消息往前冲。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你卖东西之前先卖传闻。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那今天哪条路最值得去？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "traveling_peddler",
          "text": "传闻要是对了，货就自己会找到买家。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "traveling_peddler",
          "text": "值不值得看你想要什么：稳当，还是稀奇。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_washer_grandma_after_stones",
      "npc": "washer_grandma",
      "habitat_id": "crystal_creek",
      "topic": "warm_stone_sort",
      "weight": 6,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "暖石",
        "护理"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_creek_warm_stone_sort"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "暖石排得整齐，壳幼自己就会挑。能自己挑，比你替它挑更重要。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "我还以为照料就是替它选最好的。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "今天总算看懂你为什么摆三种温度。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "最好的，是它愿意靠过去的那个。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "懂这个，以后就不会把好意做成催促。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_washer_grandma_daily_shell",
      "npc": "washer_grandma",
      "habitat_id": "crystal_creek",
      "topic": "shell_lines",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "日常",
        "壳纹",
        "护理"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "weather_in": [
          "clear",
          "fog",
          "mist"
        ]
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "壳幼今天肯把背壳转给你看，说明它不觉得你会突然碰它。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "原来“给看壳纹”也是信任。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那今天是不是适合换一块更暖的石头？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "当然，很多小东西先把背交给谁，就是先信谁。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "看纹路边上有没有发白，发白才换，别抢它自己的节奏。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_washer_grandma_pool",
      "npc": "washer_grandma",
      "habitat_id": "crystal_creek",
      "topic": "pool_reflection",
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "evt_shallow_pool_reflection"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "你看那道壳纹，亮得均匀，说明今天心静。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "原来壳纹也能看情绪。",
              "next": "shell"
            },
            {
              "text": "难怪你总挑晴天来看。",
              "next": "sun"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "shell",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "照料久了，连一圈水纹都能告诉你它想不想靠近人。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "sun",
          "speaker": "washer_grandma",
          "text": "晴天照得清，雾天就听水声。每种天色都有自己的办法。",
          "end": true
        }
      ],
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "tags": [
        "pool_reflection"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_grove_patrol_seed_line",
      "npc": "grove_patrol",
      "habitat_id": "greenbark_grove",
      "topic": "seed_line",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "路线",
        "林地"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "grove_patrol",
          "text": "栎果排出来的路只管今天，明天泥一翻，它就不是原来那条了。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你才让我只记最近三步。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "树脂味也是路标的一部分？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "grove_patrol",
          "text": "近路从来不是更长远，是更少踩错今天这一脚。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "grove_patrol",
          "text": "当然，林子先用味道说话，脚印只是后来补上的字。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_mire_guide_reed_knots",
      "npc": "mire_guide",
      "habitat_id": "reed_mire",
      "topic": "reed_knots",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "湿地",
        "路线"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "mire_guide",
          "text": "过泽地先记回身点，不是因为你会退，是因为知道能退才走得稳。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "原来折返点比入水点更早决定。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "绳结松紧是在提醒水底的泥？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "mire_guide",
          "text": "对，稳当的人不是不前进，是先给自己留一条不慌的退路。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "mire_guide",
          "text": "泥、水、风都在绳上，手比眼睛更早知道今天能不能过去。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_coast_keeper_return_crate",
      "npc": "coast_keeper",
      "habitat_id": "saltglass_coast",
      "topic": "return_crate",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "海岸",
        "潮汐"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "coast_keeper",
          "text": "海流送回来的东西不算礼物，它只是把别人没守住的那一份推到你脚边。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你先看潮痕，不先看值不值钱。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "玻片一旦起雾就很难再用了？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "coast_keeper",
          "text": "潮痕是来路，知道来路，才知道这东西还能不能信。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "coast_keeper",
          "text": "能用，但别拿去做最细的活，海边的东西总归带一点退潮后的毛边。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_storm_mentor_markers",
      "npc": "storm_mentor",
      "habitat_id": "thunder_meadow",
      "topic": "charge_markers",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "训练",
        "风暴"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "storm_mentor",
          "text": "快不是一口气冲完，是知道哪一步该收、哪一步才该放。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "难怪你先让我记停步点。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "炭痕会因为风向改位置吗？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "storm_mentor",
          "text": "记不住停，所谓加速就只是乱抢拍子。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "storm_mentor",
          "text": "会，所以你每天都得重新看。训练不是背答案，是校准节奏。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_kiln_warden_true_heat",
      "npc": "kiln_warden",
      "habitat_id": "ember_crater",
      "topic": "true_heat",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "余烬",
        "锻炉"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "kiln_warden",
          "text": "回火最骗人的时候，声音往往最大。真正该上的那一口，反而稳。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你只让我记那几拍稳的。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "边缘温石比坑心更好带走，是因为不躁？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "kiln_warden",
          "text": "对，锻火的人先学分辨真热，才配谈爆发。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "kiln_warden",
          "text": "坑心留给火自己，边缘才是给走路的人捎带回去的东西。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_bridge_scout_echo_gap",
      "npc": "bridge_scout",
      "habitat_id": "echo_broken_bridge",
      "topic": "echo_gap",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "桥头",
        "路径"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "bridge_scout",
          "text": "断桥最会骗人的是“看着还行”。真要信，还是信回音比信眼睛快。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "第一声太快，就说明那段板发空。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "你每天都要重吹一次试风哨？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "bridge_scout",
          "text": "对，空得越厉害，声音越急着回来。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "bridge_scout",
          "text": "桥会变，风也会变。昨天能走，不代表今天还讲同一套道理。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_mirror_keeper_reflection",
      "npc": "mirror_keeper",
      "habitat_id": "frost_mirror_lake",
      "topic": "reflection_hold",
      "weight": 5,
      "cooldown_days": 4,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "镜面",
        "恢复"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "mirror_keeper",
          "text": "盯整面湖，只会把自己的心也看乱。先守住一点，别的才会慢慢归位。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "原来安静不是看得更多，是先少看一点。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "最稳的那一点要怎么找？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "mirror_keeper",
          "text": "对，恢复从来不是把一切都压住，是先给自己一个不晃的位置。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "mirror_keeper",
          "text": "找最慢的那一丝雾，它不抢你，你也别急着追它。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_ruin_diviner_second_echo",
      "npc": "ruin_diviner",
      "habitat_id": "moonfen_ruins",
      "topic": "second_echo",
      "weight": 4,
      "cooldown_days": 5,
      "requires_unlock": true,
      "tags": [
        "事件后续",
        "终局",
        "余响"
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "ruin_diviner",
          "text": "第一道回响只会学你，第二道才开始说井自己想说的话。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "所以你总让我慢半拍再回答。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "那最快接上的那句话最不该信？",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "ruin_diviner",
          "text": "慢半拍不是迟钝，是给真假留一点分开的时间。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "ruin_diviner",
          "text": "在这种地方，最先贴上来的答案通常最想把你领偏。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_anomaly_researcher_after_soft_contact",
      "npc": "anomaly_researcher",
      "habitat_id": "radiant_spire",
      "topic": "soft_contact",
      "weight": 3,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "后续",
        "异常",
        "照护"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "soc_spire_reassure_fawn"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "今天它没再一下退到最远的位置。对塔区来说，这已经是很罕见的让步。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "说明你现在的动作它认得了。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "它也在学着判断你不是危险。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "是，先让对方认得你的节奏，很多记录才有资格继续往下做。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "我宁愿它慢一点，也不要它在误判里受第二次惊。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_moss_keeper_after_cofeeding",
      "npc": "moss_keeper",
      "habitat_id": "mist_moss_cave",
      "topic": "settled_nest",
      "weight": 3,
      "cooldown_days": 2,
      "tags": [
        "后续",
        "护理",
        "窝巢"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "soc_moss_settle_nest"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "照护不是把东西塞进去，而是让窝里的小家伙愿意自己把身子放回去。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "今天它回窝的动作确实快了。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "原来添料的顺序也会影响它安不安心。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "那就对了，说明温度和气味都没被我们粗暴地切断。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "moss_keeper",
          "text": "很多时候，顺序就是态度。它们听不懂话，却能记住动作。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_story_spire_soft_contact",
      "npc": "anomaly_researcher",
      "habitat_id": "radiant_spire",
      "topic": "rift_fawn_contact",
      "weight": 1,
      "cooldown_days": 3,
      "tags": [
        "剧情",
        "异常",
        "关系"
      ],
      "conditions": {
        "after_event": "soc_spire_reassure_fawn"
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "我以前总把这里当成要先“控制住”的地方。可最近我更确定，有些窗口其实是要先被信任，才会真正稳定。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "你是在说塔区，也是在说那只隙鹿。",
              "next": "reply_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "能让它留下来，本身就是一种测量结果。",
              "next": "reply_b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_a",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "对。疏散线可以画在地上，但“可接近的边界”只能一点点被共同学出来。",
          "end": true
        },
        {
          "id": "reply_b",
          "speaker": "anomaly_researcher",
          "text": "而且这种结果没法靠抢时间得到。它只会在一次次没有惊扰的记录里慢慢出现。",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
